     3. For each row, extract the price from the second column (index 1).
     4. Compare the extracted price with the current maximum price found so far. If the new price is greater than the current maximum, update the maximum price found so far.
     5. After iterating through all rows, the maximum price found so far will be the highest price among all dishes.

